    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIGame</strong> is a classical intellectual game (first released in 2002) that lets you test your knowledge in a competitive atmosphere. In this game, you can challenge both experienced players and smart bots, showcasing your expertise across various fields.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Thematic Packs:</strong> Play quizzes on general knowledge, books, movies, cartoons and anime, music, and video games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Own Questions:</strong> Become a game creator by designing your own question packs. Invite friends to play in your unique setting and prove how well you know your own questions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mode:</strong> Play with friends, compete in PvP mode, and find out who among you is the true master of intellectual games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIGame</strong> offers engaging gameplay, a wide range of topics, and various game modes. Immerse yourself in the world of knowledge, test your intellect, and enjoy the challenge with <strong>SIGame</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIGame</strong> is a classical intellectual game (first released in 2002) that lets you test your knowledge in a competitive atmosphere. In this game, you can challenge both experienced players and smart bots, showcasing your expertise across various fields.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Thematic Packs:</strong> Play quizzes on general knowledge, books, movies, cartoons and anime, music, and video games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Own Questions:</strong> Become a game creator by designing your own question packs. Invite friends to play in your unique setting and prove how well you know your own questions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mode:</strong> Play with friends, compete in PvP mode, and find out who among you is the true master of intellectual games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIGame</strong> offers engaging gameplay, a wide range of topics, and various game modes. Immerse yourself in the world of knowledge, test your intellect, and enjoy the challenge with <strong>SIGame</strong>!</p>",
